    "4.4.2": {
      "comment": "copy.md §4.4 逐项检查 · 4.4.2 · 汇总下面的一行。繁体 22 个字，默认字号一行放得下；字号放大了会折行，折了也行",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faces, phone numbers and the like are covered automatically. Turn off any you don't need."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人脸、手机号这些已经自动遮上，不用就关掉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人臉、手機號碼這些已經自動遮上，不用就關掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4.4.3": {
      "comment": "copy.md §4.4 逐项检查 · 4.4.3 · 图上有没遮的文字行时才显示。右边带一个文字按钮「手动框选」（4.8.3）；要做什么按钮已经说了，这句只说原因。繁体 10 个字、英文 19 个字符，默认字号在按钮左边都是一行",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names aren't found."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
